# Bulk auto-fetched proxy task fixtures (fetch-proxy-tasks.mjs writes per-epic subdirs of
# live Linear text) stay out of this public repo. Exception: curated, deliberately-committed
# fixtures — the flat *.json files here (routing graded-leaf cases) and the recommend/ context
# bundles — are checked in (Harbour OS is a public pet project; LinearViewer is this public repo's
# own tracker) so the evals' realistic bars run on any clone / in CI without a token (LIN-587).
scripts/eval/fixtures/*
!scripts/eval/fixtures/*.json
!scripts/eval/fixtures/recommend/
!scripts/eval/fixtures/recommend/*.json
